      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Bug still in Beta 1226. You still cant copy paste generated text.\nTemp workaround: use log system with Debug.Log() to save it, then you can grab it and copypaste inside inputfield.\nNot to grab text from generated text in Inputfield. It's broken (looks sort of multi-layer field now)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
