  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-14T18:35:35.869Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When attempting to open an InputField with dynamically populated text, the Keyboard does not load said text, preventing copy and paste.\n \n# Environment\n- SDK: 3.1.6-Beta 1 (VPM).\n- Client Hardware: Oculus Quest 2\n- Client: App Lab Beta (1222)\n- InputField marked Read Only\n \n![Video Demonstration](https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1008442619627577354/com.vrchat.oculus.quest.applab-20220814-132233.mp4)\n \nRelated: [InputField keyboard doesn't respect ReadOnly](https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1222-inputfield-keyboard-doesnt-respect-readonly)\n\n**Update** — Issue occurs with Read/Write textboxes too. InputFields text element is not copied to the keyboard; only keyboard input text is copied.",
